      "comment": "VOODOO MAC (1) is racing well without winning, recording three minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when third (19.95) over 352m at this track. Deserves a win and gets her chance. BALI CHARLIE (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (31.02) in a Maiden at Q Parklands. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Has ability and can atone. PAW FRONTIER (7) is a handily bred pup making his debut without a trial. Likely to run well. GO COLE (3) is by Aston Rupee out of Days Of Thunder making debut. Market to provide the best guide to his chances.",
